,"Upcoming events","Full calendar","No events on the books yet","New meetings and actions land on the %s first — subscribe there and never miss one.","calendar","View event","From the blog","All posts","Read the post","Posts coming soon","The chapter is writing its first dispatches — check back shortly.","Home","Featured","Search posts…","No posts yet","The chapter blog is warming up. Check back soon.","Never miss a post","One email when we publish. No spam, no lists sold — ever.","Subscribe","Share","Copy link","Email it","Read next","Get involved","Meetings, actions and committees are open to everyone. Come find your place in the work.","Event calendar","Month","List","Nothing scheduled this month","Check the next month or subscribe below and never miss one.","Subscribe to the calendar","Add every meeting and action to your own calendar automatically.","Google Calendar","iCal \u002F .ics","RSVP","Add to calendar","About this event","Details","Date","Time","Location","Save your spot","RSVP and we’ll send the details straight to you.","RSVP Now","Questions? Contact","More upcoming events","On this page","Related","Document","What it covers","Action","Documents","Contact","Questions, ideas, or press —","Never miss an update","One email when something new lands — meetings, actions, and posts. No spam, ever.","Update my dues","Need to report something?","Page not found","This page got organized out of existence","The page you’re looking for isn’t here — it may have moved, or the link may be broken.","Back home","See the calendar",[185,189,192,195,198,201],{"id":186,"label":187,"color":188},"chapter","Chapter-Wide","#B01B22",{"id":190,"label":26,"color":191},"poled","#33518F",{"id":193,"label":29,"color":194},"mutual","#1B6B40",{"id":196,"label":32,"color":197},"labor","#8F5715",{"id":199,"label":38,"color":200},"electoral","#6E3B87",{"id":202,"label":203,"color":204},"social","Social","#0A6B74",{"lang":4,"id":206,"path":207,"kind":208,"template":209,"title":210,"lede":22,"content":211,"documents":212,"grievance":213,"newhere":214,"about":110,"gi":110,"calendar":110,"languages":218,"seo":222},2,"\u002Fsample-page\u002F","page","page.php","Sample Page","\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is an example page. It&#8217;s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cblockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hi there! I&#8217;m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like piña coladas. (And gettin&#8217; caught in the rain.)\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003C\u002Fblockquote>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8230;or something like this:\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cblockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003C\u002Fblockquote>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a new WordPress user, you should go to \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Frgvdsa.test:8890\u002Fwp-admin\u002F\">your dashboard\u003C\u002Fa> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!\u003C\u002Fp>\n",[],{"show":11,"body":22},{"heading":215,"body":216,"link_label":217,"url":79,"external":16},"New here?","Come to an \u003Cspan class=\"notranslate\">PROGRESS 101\u003C\u002Fspan> — our intro session for new and curious folks.","Find a session",[219,221],{"code":4,"label":9,"name":10,"active":11,"url":220},"https:\u002F\u002Frgvdsa.te